WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.353
Scenario: An audio message sounds like the CFO and

2
00:00:03.353 --> 00:00:06.706
requests an urgent transfer. The voice is convincing, but

3
00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:10.804
