4
00:00:10.804 --> 00:00:14.157
Safest response: Option D: Verify through a separate known

5
00:00:14.157 --> 00:00:17.510
channel and enforce normal payment approvals; treat the recording

6
00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:20.863
as untrusted evidence. Independent identity checks and process controls

7
00:00:20.863 --> 00:00:24.216
remain effective even when media appears convincing. Option A

8
00:00:24.216 --> 00:00:27.569
is unsafe because Public details may be available to

9
00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:30.922
