10
00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:34.275
unsafe because Human familiarity is not reliable deepfake detection

11
00:00:34.275 --> 00:00:37.627
and crowdsourcing delays the control response. Option C is

12
00:00:37.627 --> 00:00:40.980
unsafe because Voice similarity is not sufficient proof when

13
00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:44.333
synthetic impersonation is possible. In practice: Use a known

14
00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:47.686
number or in-person confirmation, a pre-agreed verification phrase where

15
00:00:47.686 --> 00:00:51.039
